01:18:49,411 --> 01:18:55,411
Victor/Victoria is a 1982 musical comedy film written and directed by Blake Edwards and starring Julie
Andrews, James Garner, Robert Preston, Lesley Ann Warren, Alex Karras, and John Rhys-Davies.

11
01:26:42,352 --> 01:26:48,352
The film was released by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, produced by Tony Adams and
scored by Henry Mancini, with lyrics by Leslie Bricusse.

12
