The film was nominated for seven Academy Awards,
winning for Best Original Score.

13
01:42:28,235 --> 01:42:34,235
It was a remake of the German film comedy Viktor und Viktoria shot
by Reinhold Schünzel in 1933 from his own script.

14
01:50:21,176 --> 01:50:27,176
Victor/Victoria was adapted as a Broadway musical in 1995.

15
